<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 730 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 730 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 730 million pesos from the secondary market on Monday through a combination of three direct sales of paper and one repurchase agreements, dealers said.</p>
<p>The Cetes sales were offered or assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>    150 million    339 days</p>
<p>    150 million    178 days</p>
<p>    150 million     87 days</p>
<p>The terms and maturities of the repurchase agreement was offered as follows:</p>
<p>    280 million	1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
